file mantra/src/weave.rye Weave.from_v1 lifts an elder v1 record as one hand; V1Row, v1_site, v1_run, and two named refusals beside it, with the head line the head scan holds the module to.
file mantra/src/weave_v1_lift_witness.rye ten claims and four refusals, the load-bearing one comparing the lifted document against the elder reader's own rule line for line.
file tools/m/mantra_weave_v1_lift_witness.rish the rostered guard; asserts declared=6 by name so the widened head class cannot narrow again in silence.
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_weave_v1_lift_control.sh fifteen phases, three innocence legs, every break planted then lifted, including head_digit for the name shape that was unreadable.
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_weave_head_scan.sh the name class widened to [a-z][a-z0-9_]* on both readings -- REDS %612's repair.
file construction/REDS.md %612 booked and closed; %604 and %607 folded to make room at the pin's exact bound.
file construction/archive/REDS-a-repair-stops-where-the-hand-was-looking-rows-604-607.md the shelf, with what the two rows say together.
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri mantra_weave_v1_lift rostered tier lap.
file construction/ITINERARY.md the live front, elder account shelved, Git nib carried.
file session-logs/date/README-index-20260908.md one misordered row repaired by index_shelf_repair.sh -- the index_row_bound red from the cold open, closed.
scope mantra/src/weave.rye and its new lift witness, the head scan, the ledger, the card, the shelf
status GREEN -- mantra_weave_v1_lift, mantra_weave_merge, mantra_weave_annotate, mantra_weave_model, mantra_glow_tend_limb1..4, index_row_bound, reds_ledger_headline, reds_row_present, reds_status_consistency, reds_spine_derive, reds_ledger_monotone, tame_style_check, width_check all GREEN on metal. stash_record stays another seat's row.
